                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "*BUUUURP* Gobblers working in factories? Yup, I heard about that. Not me though. No-sir-e-bob. That's against the Gobbler code.",
